BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_23a55f41-787f-33a7-84e2-50b5959dbe54.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
